ds where the last one dropped off, and the truck never drives empty in between. Reorder the stops to decide which deadline it meets first, or add another job while it is still driving.Prices change. The rate for a type of cargo ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T17:09:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814456336","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4978350-1840310314343126","game_id":"steam-4978350","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out now","summary":"Core Logistics is a management sim about running a trucking company — reading a freight market you can never see all of, and committing a fleet that is always too small for it. What's in the demo The demo is the opening arc: one region, your first trucks, and the point where the company outgrows the setup that got it there. That's where it ends, and where the full game picks up — with hubs, cross-region work, and standing orders that run the routine for you. Playable in five languages English, P","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T20:48:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314343126","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4978350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4978350":"2026-10-26T15:59:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4978350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:10Z"},"5038150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T1